<title>USA: GBC Bancorp raises dividend.</title>
<headline>GBC Bancorp raises dividend.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>GBC Bancorp said Friday it increased its quarterly dividend to $0.12 per share from $0.10.</p>
<p>The new dividend is payable April 15 to shareholders of record March 31.</p>
</text>
